      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-62330",
      ":question/problem": "Hank finished the first round at an archery competition with a mean score of $9$ points. His scores for this round are given below:\n\n$10, 8, 8, 10$\n\nErika, Hank's competitor, completed her round with a mean absolute deviation (MAD) of $0.5$ points.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. Hank's scores have a mean absolute deviation of $0.5$.\n2. A comparison of the MADs suggests Erika's scores have a smaller spread than Hank's.\n3. A comparison of the MADs suggests Erika's scores have the same spread as Hank's."
    },
